<h1 data-copy-en="Cinnamon" data-copy-zh="Cinnamon">Cinnamon</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Room commission checklist, recruitment and worker upgrades." data-copy-zh="房间建设清单、招募与员工升级。">Room commission checklist, recruitment and worker upgrades.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Before_Recruitment"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Bazaar_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Building_Her_Performance_Room"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="After_the_Move"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Home_H2Hs_and_Costs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Home_H2H_Best_Ordinary_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Safe_Landing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Rafter_Quiet"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Your_Seat,_Saved"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Your_Seat.2C_Saved"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="H2H_Special_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Cinnamon"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Resort_Pair_and_Trio_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Cinnamon — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/cinnamon.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Cinnamon — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/cinnamon.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Cinnamon — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Cinnamon’s recruitment is a room commission after her personal events, H2Hs and Bazaar date. Prepare the building materials before trying to move her into Rose &amp; Thorn.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Acrobat Training Hall: 06:00–21:00 before recruitment. After the room commission, find her at Cinnamon's Room from 06:00–23:00. Her normal portrait moves rather than remaining at both places.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><details><summary>Room commission checklist</summary><ul><li>Own Rose &amp; Thorn and build the Menagerie.</li><li>Complete her introduction, Landing Practice at Known (25), The Old Poster at Friend (100), New Routine at Close Friend (200), then First Bow at Crush (400).</li><li>Safe Landing → Rafter Quiet; finish both H2Hs.</li><li>Balance Notes: Friend (100), Ability 35; complete once.</li><li>Bazaar Date: complete once.</li><li>Return to the Acrobat Training Hall with $250,000 and 100 common, 50 rare and 10 epic materials. The commission takes 240 minutes.</li></ul></details><p>The commission recruits her and opens the room. Visit that room for Room for Ideas, then Your Seat, Saved at Crush (400), 06:00–22:00.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Cat Girl Acrobat</th><td data-label="Requirements">Acrobat Training Hall; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Landing Practice</th><td data-label="Requirements">Acrobat Training Hall; 06:00–21:00; Cinnamon Known (25); The Cat Girl Acrobat</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Old Poster</th><td data-label="Requirements">Acrobat Training Hall; 06:00–21:00; Cinnamon Friend (100); Landing Practice</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A New Routine</th><td data-label="Requirements">Acrobat Training Hall; 06:00–21:00; Cinnamon Close Friend (200); The Old Poster</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The First Bow</th><td data-label="Requirements">Acrobat Training Hall; 06:00–21:00; Cinnamon Crush (400); A New Routine</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Room for Ideas</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cinnamon's Room; 06:00–23:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon not on vacation; Cinnamon recruited</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Neighbours Off Duty</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Beach; 08:00–16:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Foxy recruited; Cinnamon, Foxy on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Foxy +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Spare Seat</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Beach; 08:00–16:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Whiskers recruited; Cinnamon, Whiskers on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Whiskers +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Missing Final Note</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Beach; 17:00–20:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Sandra recruited; Cinnamon, Sandra on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Sandra +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Appointment Needed</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Spa; 19:00–23:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Willow recruited; Cinnamon, Willow on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Willow +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Visiting Hours</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Spa; 19:00–23:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Elara recruited; Cinnamon, Elara on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Elara +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">An Independent Opinion</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Buffet; 11:00–16:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Sophie recruited; Cinnamon, Sophie on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Sophie +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">An Appetite for Trouble</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Buffet; 11:00–16:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Honey recruited; Cinnamon, Honey on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Honey +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Price of an Encore</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Buffet; 11:00–16:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Jade recruited; Cinnamon, Jade on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Jade +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Nothing Up Her Sleeve</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Beach; 17:00–20:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Vixen recruited; Cinnamon, Vixen on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Vixen +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Off Balance</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Beach; 08:00–16:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Valkyra recruited; Cinnamon, Valkyra on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Valkyra +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Smallest Bow</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Beach; 08:00–16:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Pepper recruited; Cinnamon, Pepper on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Pepper +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Request of Her Own</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Spa; 19:00–23:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Ryia recruited; Cinnamon, Ryia on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Ryia +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Terms of Company</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Beach; 08:00–16:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Foxy, Whiskers recruited; Cinnamon, Foxy, Whiskers on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Foxy +3; Whiskers +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Completely True Story</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Buffet; 11:00–16:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Sandra, Vixen recruited; Cinnamon, Sandra, Vixen on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Sandra +3; Vixen +3</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ordinary_Actions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits_and_Eight_Training_Levels"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crafted-Gift_Training_Upgrades"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><details><summary>Action costs, requirements and rewards</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Acrobat Training Hall / Cinnamon's Room; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Chocolate</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Acrobat Training Hall / Cinnamon's Room; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; −3 Energy; 1 Chocolate</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+6 base affection; 2/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Safe Landing</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Acrobat Training Hall; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rafter Quiet</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Acrobat Training Hall; Close Friend (200); Safe Landing</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Balance Notes</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Acrobat Training Hall; Friend (100); Ability 35</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; requires 18 Energy available. Energy is not spent.</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+8 direct affection; Ability +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Bazaar Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Acrobat Training Hall; Friend (100); 09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $75; −35 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +5 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Build Performance Room</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Acrobat Training Hall; complete the room checklist below</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">240 min; $250,000; 100 common materials; 50 rare materials; 10 epic materials</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">Performance Room; recruits Cinnamon; once; +10 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Your Seat, Saved</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cinnamon's Room; Crush (400); A Room to Perform; Room for Ideas; Rafter Quiet; 06:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>Her later training upgrade scenes require In Love (3000), Room for Ideas and Your Seat, Saved. Resort activities also become relevant after recruitment; the shared-event table distinguishes who must be vacationing together.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: permanent worker training upgrades</summary><p>These are extra portrait actions for permanent worker training improvements. Carry the specified crafted gift; it is consumed. Each upgrade doubles training experience for its own training and adds +50% worker income, stacking additively with the other upgrade.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Conditions / start time</th><th scope="col">Cost</th><th scope="col">Result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">No Audience Required</th><td data-label="Conditions / start time">Cinnamon's Room; Cinnamon In Love (3000); Room for Ideas; Cinnamon: Your Seat, Saved; Cinnamon not on vacation; 06:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; consumes 1 Hexbound Rose Sachet</td><td data-label="Result">Oral upgrade; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Landing Between Us</th><td data-label="Conditions / start time">Cinnamon's Room; Cinnamon In Love (3000); Room for Ideas; Cinnamon: Your Seat, Saved; Cinnamon not on vacation; 06:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; consumes 1 Golden Pulse Bracelet</td><td data-label="Result">Missionary upgrade; once</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>Optional reference: while on vacation</summary><p>Assign her to vacation through Worker Rooms first. Resort portraits are rolled on arrival and are not guaranteed at every stop. These contextual activities replace the usual home menu while she is encountered there; the sunset H2H has no extra affection threshold for Brandy or Cinnamon.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Activity</th><th scope="col">Place / start time</th><th scope="col">Time / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Place / start time">07:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Time / normal limit">15 min; 6/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Eat together</th><td data-label="Place / start time">Sirena Isle Buffet 11:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Time / normal limit">60 min; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relax together</th><td data-label="Place / start time">Sirena Isle Beach 08:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Time / normal limit">60 min; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Evening spa visit</th><td data-label="Place / start time">Sirena Isle Spa 19:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Time / normal limit">60 min; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sunset walk H2H</th><td data-label="Place / start time">Sirena Isle Beach 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Time / normal limit">60 min; 1/day, repeatable on later days</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">See the Resort guide for resort construction, vacation slots and shared rewards.</a></p></details><details><summary>Optional reference: relationship bonuses</summary><p>Meeting each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 to ordinary base affection before the remaining relationship bonuses. The favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct one-time affection rewards are added as listed.</p><p>Charm 55; Ability 55; Luck 55</p><p>Favorite skill: Animal Care</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Listed time and resources are base values; applicable skills, difficulty and active bonuses can change the shown cost or affection. Base affection, direct affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>A missing Build Performance Room button usually means a checklist event, H2H, date or the Menagerie is still unfinished. Money alone does not unlock it.</li><li>After moving, look in Cinnamon’s Room instead of waiting at the training hall.</li><li>Your Seat, Saved ends its start window at 22:00, one hour before her portrait disappears.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Construction and worker training</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Resort</a></li><li><a href="character-ember.html">Ember</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Before_Recruitment"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Bazaar_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Building_Her_Performance_Room"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-After_the_Move"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Home_H2Hs_and_Costs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Home_H2H_Best_Ordinary_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Safe_Landing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Rafter_Quiet"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Your_Seat,_Saved"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Your_Seat.2C_Saved"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-H2H_Special_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Cinnamon"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Resort_Pair_and_Trio_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Cinnamon 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/cinnamon.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Cinnamon 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/cinnamon.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Cinnamon 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Cinnamon 的招募通过房间建设委托完成，前置包含个人事件、谈心与集市约会。请先准备建设材料，再推进她搬入玫瑰与荆棘。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里找到</h2><p>杂技训练厅：招募前为 06:00–21:00；房间委托完成后，改在Cinnamon的房间于 06:00–23:00 出现，不会同时留在两个地点。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><details><summary>房间建设清单</summary><ul><li>拥有玫瑰与荆棘，并建成珍兽苑。</li><li>依次完成介绍、已知（25）的着陆练习、朋友（100）的旧海报、亲密朋友（200）的新的惯例，以及迷恋（400）的第一次谢幕鞠躬。</li><li>安全落地 → 梁下的宁静，两段谈心都要完成。</li><li>平衡笔记：朋友（100）、能力 35，完成一次。</li><li>集市约会：完成一次。</li><li>带上 $250,000、100 普通材料、50 稀有材料与 10 史诗材料，返回杂技训练厅。建设委托耗时 240 分钟。</li></ul></details><p>委托完成后，她加入员工名单并开放房间。回访房间触发给点子一个家后，可在迷恋（400）、06:00–22:00 进行「为你留的座位」。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">猫娘杂技演员</th><td data-label="条件">杂技训练厅; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">着陆练习</th><td data-label="条件">杂技训练厅; 06:00–21:00; Cinnamon 已知 (25); 猫娘杂技演员</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">旧海报</th><td data-label="条件">杂技训练厅; 06:00–21:00; Cinnamon 朋友 (100); 着陆练习</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">新的惯例</th><td data-label="条件">杂技训练厅; 06:00–21:00; Cinnamon 亲密朋友 (200); 旧海报</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第一次谢幕鞠躬</th><td data-label="条件">杂技训练厅; 06:00–21:00; Cinnamon 迷恋 (400); 新的惯例</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">给点子一个家</th><td data-label="条件">Cinnamon的房间; 06:00–23:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon 未在度假; 已招募 Cinnamon</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">休假中的邻居</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛海滩; 08:00–16:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Foxy 已招募; Cinnamon, Foxy 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Foxy +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">预留的座位</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛海滩; 08:00–16:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Whiskers 已招募; Cinnamon, Whiskers 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Whiskers +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">缺失的尾音</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛海滩; 17:00–20:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Sandra 已招募; Cinnamon, Sandra 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Sandra +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">无需预约</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛水疗馆; 19:00–23:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Willow 已招募; Cinnamon, Willow 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Willow +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">探访时间</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛水疗馆; 19:00–23:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Elara 已招募; Cinnamon, Elara 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Elara +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">独立的意见</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛自助餐; 11:00–16:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Sophie 已招募; Cinnamon, Sophie 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Sophie +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">麻烦正合胃口</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛自助餐; 11:00–16:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Honey 已招募; Cinnamon, Honey 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Honey +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">加演的代价</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛自助餐; 11:00–16:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Jade 已招募; Cinnamon, Jade 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Jade +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">袖中无物</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛海滩; 17:00–20:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Vixen 已招募; Cinnamon, Vixen 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Vixen +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">失去平衡</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛海滩; 08:00–16:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Valkyra 已招募; Cinnamon, Valkyra 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Valkyra +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">小小一鞠躬</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛海滩; 08:00–16:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Pepper 已招募; Cinnamon, Pepper 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Pepper +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">她自己的请求</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛水疗馆; 19:00–23:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Ryia 已招募; Cinnamon, Ryia 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Ryia +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">陪伴条款</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛海滩; 08:00–16:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Foxy, Whiskers 已招募; Cinnamon, Foxy, Whiskers 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Foxy +3; Whiskers +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">千真万确的故事</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛自助餐; 11:00–16:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Sandra, Vixen 已招募; Cinnamon, Sandra, Vixen 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Sandra +3; Vixen +3</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ordinary_Actions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits_and_Eight_Training_Levels"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Crafted-Gift_Training_Upgrades"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><details><summary>行动消耗、条件与奖励</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">杂技训练厅／Cinnamon的房间; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 5次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送巧克力</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">杂技训练厅／Cinnamon的房间; 已知 (25)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10 分钟; −3 精力; 1 巧克力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+6 基础好感度; 2次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">安全落地</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">杂技训练厅; 已知 (25)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −15 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">梁下的宁静</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">杂技训练厅; 亲密朋友 (200); 安全落地</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −15 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">平衡笔记</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">杂技训练厅; 朋友 (100); 能力 35</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45分钟；开始时需有18精力，不扣除精力。</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+8 直接好感度; 能力 +1; 一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">集市约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">杂技训练厅; 朋友 (100); 09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $75; −35 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +5 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">建造Cinnamon的表演室</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">杂技训练厅; 完成下方房间建设清单</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">240 分钟; $250,000; 100 普通材料; 50 稀有材料; 10 史诗材料</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">表演室；招募 Cinnamon；一次性; +10 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">为你留的座位</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Cinnamon的房间; 迷恋 (400); 一间属于她的表演室; 给点子一个家; 梁下的宁静; 06:00–22:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −15 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>后期训练升级事件要求恋爱中（3000）、完成给点子一个家及为你留的座位。招募后也能安排度假；共同事件表会区分哪些角色需要同时度假。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：永久员工训练升级</summary><p>这些额外肖像行动可永久强化员工训练。需携带指定制作礼物，并会消耗礼物。每次升级使对应训练获得的经验翻倍，且每项增加 50% 员工收入，两项收入加成相加。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗</th><th scope="col">效果</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">无需观众</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Cinnamon的房间; Cinnamon 恋爱中 (3000); 给点子一个家; Cinnamon: 为你留的座位; Cinnamon 未在度假; 06:00–23:00</td><td data-label="消耗">0 分钟；消耗 1 咒缚玫瑰香囊</td><td data-label="效果">口交训练升级；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">我们之间的落点</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Cinnamon的房间; Cinnamon 恋爱中 (3000); 给点子一个家; Cinnamon: 为你留的座位; Cinnamon 未在度假; 06:00–23:00</td><td data-label="消耗">0 分钟；消耗 1 金脉手镯</td><td data-label="效果">传教士位训练升级；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>可选查阅：度假期间</summary><p>先通过员工房间安排她度假。抵达度假地点时才会判定遇见谁，并非每次都能见到她。遇见时会显示度假专用菜单；Brandy 与 Cinnamon 的日落谈心没有额外好感度门槛。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">活动</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">耗时／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">07:00–23:00</td><td data-label="耗时／常规次数">15 分钟；6次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一起用餐</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">塞壬岛自助餐 11:00–16:00</td><td data-label="耗时／常规次数">60 分钟；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一起放松</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">塞壬岛海滩 08:00–16:00</td><td data-label="耗时／常规次数">60 分钟；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">夜间水疗</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">塞壬岛水疗馆 19:00–23:00</td><td data-label="耗时／常规次数">60 分钟；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">日落散步谈心</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">塞壬岛海滩 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="耗时／常规次数">60 分钟；1次/日，可在之后的日子重复</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">度假村建设、度假名额与共同奖励见度假村指南。</a></p></details><details><summary>可选查阅：关系加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。标为直接好感度的一次性奖励按表中数值加入。</p><p>魅力 55; 能力 55; 幸运 55</p><p>偏好技能：动物照料</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。表中耗时与资源为基础值；适用技能、难度及当前加成可能改变界面显示的消耗或好感度。基础好感度、直接好感度、玩家情欲经验与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>常见卡点</h2><ul><li>建设按钮未出现时，通常是清单中的事件、谈心、约会或珍兽苑仍未完成，只有金钱还不够。</li><li>搬入后请去 Cinnamon的房间，不必继续等在训练厅。</li><li>为你留的座位在 22:00 截止开始，比她离场时间早一小时。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">建设与员工训练</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">度假村</a></li><li><a href="character-ember.html">Ember</a></li></ul></section>
